<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Writing a CSV.

  The choices were in a three-column grid with invisible spinners padding out
  the empty cells, so the tick boxes landed in two ragged columns and half of
  them were cut off on a narrow screen. They are questions, and questions go
  one under another.

